{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n34歲的鄺潔楹（Judy）在TVB節目《玫瑰戰爭》中飾演蠢萌明星仔安安，表現獲正評不斷，多場豁出去的演出更成為網民熱話！當中一幕被箍頸至反白眼的場面，因狀態極度像真而獲洗版式激讚。現實中原來她入行6年從未拍過親熱戲，今次首度挑戰，背後又有甚麼秘聞？\n</p>\n<h2>箍頸反白眼夠晒豁出去 網民洗版大讚好戲</h2>\n<p>在劇中，鄺潔楹飾演的安安有多場突破性演出，除了鞋底藏鐵釘「欺騙」測謊機、在迷離狀態下援交，以及遭汽車撞飛外，最引起熱議的莫過於一場遭林景程箍頸的戲份。由於Judy「反白眼」奄奄一息的狀態極度像真，畫面震撼，獲網民洗版大讚好戲，更笑指她相當豁出去，有網民留言：「TVB藝人為演戲真的很放得開。」劇中安安的香閨貼滿自己的大頭照，其中一個咕𠱸上的照片更是Judy的「真‧童顏相」，劇組心思值得一讚。</p>\n<h2>鄺潔楹親解反白眼之謎：拍到好攰唔自覺</h2>\n<p>對於角色獲網民關注，鄺潔楹早前接受訪問時坦言，安安的性格與真實的自己完全相反，私底下的她其實文靜不多嘴，更是個深思熟慮、努力求進步的人。談到網民熱議她「反白眼」夠投入，Judy笑言拍攝時並無為意，她透露由於當日一口氣拍攝了被潑水、被箍頸及被撞飛三場重點戲，當時身體已相當疲累，可能因此不自覺地反了白眼，她更笑說：「有網民討論我開心呀，至少代表演得夠真先。」</p>\n<h2>入行6年首拍親熱戲 鄺潔楹感激對手貼心照顧</h2>\n<p>談到另一場挑戰極大的援交戲，鄺潔楹透露原來過去六年的拍劇生涯中，她從未拍過任何親熱戲，最多只是拖手，因此今次要演繹迷離狀態下的援交場口，對她而言是一大挑戰。Judy坦言非常感激劇組及對手李顯曜全程的貼心照顧，令她能在完全放心及放鬆的情況下完成演出：「劇組知我緊張，佢哋事先有問我同邊位男演員演會放鬆少少，最後搵咗李顯曜」、「李顯曜其實仲緊張過我，拍完每個鏡頭佢都不斷問有冇整到我，又會不斷幫我遮遮掩掩等我唔會走光，所以成個拍攝都好放鬆同順利。」</p>\n<h2>網民驚訝34歲童顏封「可愛萌妹」：演活蠢美女</h2>\n<p>除了演技備受肯定，網民亦對鄺潔楹的骰身形及童顏引發關注，大讚她已年屆34歲但外貌依然年輕，獲封為「可愛萌妹」，與同樣以逆齡見稱的羅毓儀並列TVB頭號「童顏美女」。網民紛紛留言激讚：「身材好，人又靚」、「演的好可愛」、「蠢美女」、「抗老代表」、「演出了那種冇乜前途的辣妹感」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_1139439016b001a607cb35.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_1139439016b001a607cb35.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_16894974726b001b44041f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/40_16894974726b001b44041f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05a_21121951536b001a6b68ace.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05a_21121951536b001a6b68ace.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7260683956b001a81e00ad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_7260683956b001a81e00ad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1830565336b001a8d947ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1830565336b001a8d947ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10751010876b001ac38c449.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_10751010876b001ac38c449.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11175870076b001ac834001.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11175870076b001ac834001.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_18939764696b001acc1a209.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_18939764696b001acc1a209.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_7171764696b001ad15c6ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_7171764696b001ad15c6ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_912639246b001ad6ba598.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_912639246b001ad6ba598.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_16451806576b001adb479a0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_16451806576b001adb479a0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_18728111576b001ade8d943.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_18728111576b001ade8d943.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_4955845826b001ae288c37.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/23_4955845826b001ae288c37.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_17356729226b001ae68e80c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/24_17356729226b001ae68e80c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T11:04:12.527854+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1313,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:32.966120+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11